{"n":101,"ar":"القارعة","name":"Al-Qari'ah","mean":"The Calamity","type":"meccan","v":[{"a":["ٱلۡقَارِعَةُ"],"w":["The Striking Calamity"],"t":["al-qāriʿatu"],"p":[1],"en":"The Striking Calamity"},{"a":["مَا","ٱلۡقَارِعَةُ"],"w":["What","(is) the Striking Calamity"],"t":["mā","l-qāriʿatu"],"p":[1,2],"en":"What is the Striking Calamity"},{"a":["وَمَآ","أَدۡرَىٰكَ","مَا","ٱلۡقَارِعَةُ"],"w":["And what","will make you know","what","(is) the Striking Calamity"],"t":["wamā","adrāka","mā","l-qāriʿatu"],"p":[1,2,3,4],"en":"And what can make you know what is the Striking Calamity"},{"a":["يَوۡمَ","يَكُونُ","ٱلنَّاسُ","كَٱلۡفَرَاشِ","ٱلۡمَبۡثُوثِ"],"w":["(The) Day","will be","the mankind","like moths","scattered"],"t":["yawma","yakūnu","l-nāsu","kal-farāshi","l-mabthūthi"],"p":[1,2,3,4,5],"en":"It is the Day when people will be like moths, dispersed"},{"a":["وَتَكُونُ","ٱلۡجِبَالُ","كَٱلۡعِهۡنِ","ٱلۡمَنفُوشِ"],"w":["And will be","the mountains","like wool","fluffed up"],"t":["watakūnu","l-jibālu","kal-ʿih'ni","l-manfūshi"],"p":[1,2,3,4],"en":"And the mountains will be like wool, fluffed up"},{"a":["فَأَمَّا","مَن","ثَقُلَتۡ","مَوَٰزِينُهُۥ"],"w":["Then as for","(him) whose","(are) heavy","his scales"],"t":["fa-ammā","man","thaqulat","mawāzīnuhu"],"p":[1,2,3,4],"en":"Then as for one whose scales are heavy [with good deeds]"},{"a":["فَهُوَ","فِي","عِيشَةࣲ","رَّاضِيَةࣲ"],"w":["Then he","(will be) in","a life","pleasant"],"t":["fahuwa","fī","ʿīshatin","rāḍiyatin"],"p":[1,2,3,4],"en":"He will be in a pleasant life"},{"a":["وَأَمَّا","مَنۡ","خَفَّتۡ","مَوَٰزِينُهُۥ"],"w":["But as for","(him) whose","(are) light","his scales"],"t":["wa-ammā","man","khaffat","mawāzīnuhu"],"p":[1,2,3,4],"en":"But as for one whose scales are light"},{"a":["فَأُمُّهُۥ","هَاوِيَةࣱ"],"w":["His abode","(will be the) Pit"],"t":["fa-ummuhu","hāwiyatun"],"p":[1,2],"en":"His refuge will be an abyss"},{"a":["وَمَآ","أَدۡرَىٰكَ","مَا","هِيَهۡ"],"w":["And what","will make you know","what","it is"],"t":["wamā",